{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50119","headline":"游仙窟诗 手中扇赠文成 · 崔十娘","name":"游仙窟诗 手中扇赠文成","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"合欢游璧水，同心侍华阙。\n飒飒似朝风，团团如夜月。\n鸾姿侵雾起，鹤影排空发。\n希君掌中握，勿使恩情歇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔十娘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}